    "name": "Palm City",
    "slug": "palm-city",
    "storyline": "A crew of aspiring criminals arrives in Palm City, a sunny metropolis controlled by a powerful mob boss. Starting with small robberies, they work their way through increasingly dangerous jobs, stealing vehicles, breaking into apartments, robbing the city bank, and confronting the criminal organization that controls the city. Along the way, failed plans, police chases, and conflicts within the crew force them to improvise if they want to pull off the ultimate heist.",
    "summary": "A first-person co-op action game set in a sunny open city. Play solo or with friends, explore the streets, plan heists, and escape with the loot. Use vehicles, the environment, and physics to your advantage when even the best-laid plan descends into chaos.",
